  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cook the pasta in boiling salted water until al dente."
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, brown the sliced garlic and thyme in olive oil in a wide frying pan. Add the broccoli and cauliflower florets, season with salt and pepper and stir-fry for 3 minutes. Add the cooked pasta and toss together for a minute or two."
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from the heat, sprinkle with grated parmesan and serve immediately."
